{"content": "# 活著\n\n<div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n<button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-1', this, 'Group')\">執意</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-2', this, 'Group')\">Persist</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-3', this, 'Group')\">執念</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-1\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: block;\">\n\n「活著變得很理所當然，但是活著很難。真的。」\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-2\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"lang-en\">\n\n“We, of course, are alive. But living is difficult. Really.”\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-3\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n:::lang[ja]\n「生きていることが当たり前になった。でも、生きるのって難しい。本当に。」\n:::\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"md-tab-end\"></div>", "hashes": {"md_source": "0fc7c74d", "art_detail": "a893aab6"}}